<h2>线性泛函</h2>
<p>在这之前提到过：<br>
<a href="/Pkmer-Math/微积分/极限/极限.html#%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8#" target="_blank">极限</a><br>
